      pipeline narrative reflects the new step ordering. The existing
      JSDoc enumerates nine steps; with the null pre-check inserted
      between steps 3 and 4, the narrative grows to ten steps. Choose
      the renumbered scheme (every step that read its old number gets
      the next integer past the inserted step) over a sub-numbered
      scheme (3.5) — sub-numbering would be a tell that the pipeline
      grew unprincipled and would conflict with the existing JSDoc's
      flat integer numbering. The new ordering, in fixed sequence:

      - Step 1 — Resolve framework config via `detectFramework(root)`
