      - Step 5 — Read `.mcp.json` at `mcpConfigPath` (was Step 4).
      - Step 6 — Parse `.mcp.json` JSON (was Step 5).
      - Step 7 — Look up `mcpServers.brain` (was Step 6).
      - Step 8 — Compute the expected entry from the parsed
        brain.aide via `interpolateArgs(config)` (was Step 7).
      - Step 9 — Structural drift comparison (was Step 8).
      - Step 10 — Happy path (was Step 9).

      Update the "Hard invariants" enumeration in the same JSDoc
      block by extending it with two new bullets that lock in the
      rework's load-bearing rules:

      - "The detector NEVER pattern-matches string contents to detect
